Attempt to submit a measurement with a BOOLEAN parameter containing a non-boolean value,Order Measurements,Negative,Medium,User is logged in as a shop owner or worker with measurement permissions. An order exists with at least one item requiring measurement. The system expects a BOOLEAN parameter but the user attempts to submit a non-boolean value.,"1. Navigate to the order details page. 2. Select an item to record measurements for. 3. In the measurement form, enter a value other than 'true' or 'false' (e.g., 'yes') in a BOOLEAN parameter field (e.g., 'Has Pockets'). 4. Submit the measurement form.

