Create an order item with a measurement parameter of type TEXT and an empty string value,Order Measurement Parameters,Boundary,High,User is logged in and on the 'Create Order' screen with at least one item added,"1. Select an item to add measurement parameters. 2. Add a new measurement parameter. 3. Set the parameter type to 'TEXT'. 4. Leave the parameter value field empty (empty string). 5. Submit the order.

